guide forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca
title The Eye of Bhossca
category Class
class Rogue
folder Rogue
levels 25-35
zone Silverpine Forest
keywords The Eye of Bhossca, C's dead drop, Dead Drop, Pyrewood Village, Scarlet Monastery, disguise, Ruby-Adorned Blade, Rogue, solo dungeon

# C's second job, for Rogues of both factions: The Eye of Bhossca (78676)
# from the Dead Drop near Pyrewood Village, the eye from inside the Scarlet
# Monastery, then C's payment (78699) from the same Dead Drop.
# Forever changes (Wowhead Forever's Rogue class page,
# data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json): both quests need level
# 25 (was 30 and 1) and pay 3450 experience; 78699 is now level 35, pays 75
# silver and adds the Ruby-Adorned Blade. Wowhead's row also lists Rune of
# Shadowstep (210979) among 78699's rewards, a Season of Discovery rune; the
# guide shows only the blade.
# Sources: quests.json and objects.json (the Dead Drop, object 410369),
# the quest text on foreverchanges.pro/quest/78676 (the eye is in the Scarlet
# Monastery, you go alone, a disguise can be found on the monastery grounds),
# the Scarlet Monastery entrance from data/forever/dungeons.json (Tirisfal
# Glades 82.6,33.8, live frame). The data has no item for the eye and no
# position for it or the disguise.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so this level 35 quest has not been checked in game.

step C's dead drop
  tip The Dead Drop is a chest near Pyrewood Village in southern Silverpine, just south of Shadowfang Keep. C's next note waits there once you are 25.
  level 25
  accept 78676 object 410369                  -- Dead Drop

step The Scarlet Monastery
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip The monastery stands in the far north-east of Tirisfal Glades. Go in alone; C advises a disguise from the monastery's grounds before you enter.
  goto 82.6,33.8 live "Scarlet Monastery"
  note Find the Eye of Bhossca inside the Scarlet Monastery.

step Back to the dead drop
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Place the eye in the Dead Drop near Pyrewood. C's payment is the second Eye of Bhossca quest at the same chest.
  turnin 78676 object 410369                  -- Dead Drop
  accept 78699 object 410369
  turnin 78699 object 410369 reward 277246    -- Ruby-Adorned Blade
